i><li><p><strong>Molecular weight</strong><span>: 534.37 g/mol</span></p></li><li><p><strong>λmax (in water)</strong><span>: 425 nm</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Water-insoluble matter</strong><span>: &lt;0.20%</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Subsidiary dyes</strong><span>: &lt;1.00%</span></p></li><li><p><strong>Heavy metals (as Pb)</strong><span>: &lt;40 mg/kg</span></p></li></ul><p>To prepare the solutions I used a jeweller's scale to weigh out the right amounts and then added tap water to the weights listed in the table.</p><div><figure><a target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nCQh!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F580184e7-0540-4be3-996c-241ffc395fda_1600x640.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nCQh!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F580184e7-0540-4be3-996c-241ffc395fda_1600x640.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nCQh!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F580184e7-0540-4be3-996c-241ffc395fda_1600x640.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nCQh!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F580184e7-0540-4be3-996c-241ffc395fda_1600x640.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nCQh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F580184e7-0540-4be3-996c-241ffc395fda_1600x640.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!nCQh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F580184e7-0540-4be3-996c-241ffc39